		{"id":"2851b9c18124dc5c","x":1047,"y":-173,"width":593,"height":193,"type":"text","text":"Umugites are a cult similar to real-life Assassins, dwelling on mountaintops and obedient to Umug, who they call their god. They believe that as long as they are an asset to the plans of Umug, he shall not let them die in combat; should they die, he shall grant them entrance to his special paradise.\nUmugites wear tall, feathered collars that separate into two pointy shapes -- similar to Umug's fabled hare ears. They fight with spears and lances."}
